#: wizard.cpp:75
msgid "Nepomuk Data Migration"
msgstr "Nepomuk migracija podataka"

#: wizard.cpp:80
msgid ""
"With this new release Nepomuk has migrated its internal data format. You "
"have launched this wizard because you wish to migrate your data and not go "
"with the recommended method of backup and restore. This migration can take "
"several hours"
msgstr ""
"U novoj verziji Nepomuk je promijenio interni format podataka. Pokreniuli "
"ste ovaj čarobnjak jer želite migrirati vaše podatke a ne ići preporučenim "
"metodom rezervnih kopija i obnova. Ova migracija može trajati više sati"

#: wizard.cpp:107
msgid "The internal data is being migrated"
msgstr "Interni podaci su u toku migracije"

#: wizard.cpp:108
msgid "This process could take a while"
msgstr "Ovaj proces može potrajati"

#: wizard.cpp:158
msgid "Data has been successfully migrated"
msgstr "Podaci su uspješno migrirali"
